---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Status"
  description="DeadMTL is under construction. The first enclave is being mapped: Saint-Paul-Emard."
>
  <div class="construction-page">
    <div class="const__inner">
      <div class="const__signal">&#x25A0; Signal Active</div>

      <span class="logo-display" style="font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 8vw, 5.5rem); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; display: block;">
        DEADMTL
      </span>

      <p class="const__body">DeadMTL is under construction.</p>

      <p class="const__enclave">
        First enclave being mapped: Saint-Paul-&Eacute;mard
      </p>

      <p class="const__body">
        The southwest is being charted. Canal lines, pressure zones,
        broken road access, and the Mercier situation. The server will
        open when the map is ready.
      </p>

      <p class="const__body">
        No fake launch dates. No false signals. When it is ready, it will be here.
      </p>

      <nav class="const__nav" aria-label="Construction page navigation">
        <a href="/" class="btn btn--ghost">Return Home</a>
        <a href="/archive" class="btn btn--secondary">Archive Placeholder</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
